they just, by the way, renewed us

00:05:46.640 --> 00:05:48.185 line:92%
for a second season. - Nice!

00:05:48.185 --> 00:05:49.800 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
(audience cheers)

00:05:49.800 --> 00:05:51.765 line:92%
- It's the first time I'm mentioning it publicly.

00:05:51.765 --> 00:05:52.673 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
- Oh yeah!

00:05:52.673 --> 00:05:54.048 size:75% position:38% line:92%
- I found out today!

00:05:54.048 --> 00:05:54.881 size:78% position:39% line:92%
- That's so exciting!

00:05:54.881 --> 00:05:55.714 size:75% position:38% line:92%
- I found out today.

00:05:55.714 --> 00:05:58.050 line:92%
We're going to do a bunch more this next year.

00:05:58.050 --> 00:05:59.390 line:92%
I had a great time shooting them.

00:05:59.390 --> 00:06:03.332 line:92%
They are me, following, you know,

00:06:03.332 --> 00:06:06.639 line:92%
familiar objects, like flowers,

00:06:06.639 --> 00:06:08.750 line:92%
- Or coffee, - Or coffee, we did.

00:06:08.750 --> 00:06:10.700 line:92%
We did sneakers, barbecues, RV's,

00:06:10.700 --> 00:06:13.183 line:92%
cosmetics, jewelry, different things.

00:06:13.183 --> 00:06:14.530 line:92%
- Just every day things. - Swimming pools.

00:06:14.530 --> 00:06:15.450 size:84% position:42% line:92%
Yeah, every day things.

00:06:15.450 --> 00:06:16.730 line:92%
But we find the interesting,

00:06:16.730 --> 00:06:19.480 line:92%
complicated surprising things about them,

00:06:19.480 --> 00:06:21.230 line:92%
and then I move in and out of

00:06:21.230 --> 00:06:22.770 line:92%
the aficionados on the subject

00:06:22.770 --> 00:06:24.690 size:84% position:42% line:92%
and have an experience.

00:06:24.690 --> 00:06:28.279 line:92%
It may give way to my personal associations,

00:06:28.279 --> 00:06:31.394 line:92%
