00:06:31.394 --> 00:06:35.890 line:92%
And also, some facts about them that may be interesting.

00:06:35.890 --> 00:06:38.520 line:92%
And some abstractions, and larger ideas.

00:06:38.520 --> 00:06:39.353 line:92%
What do you think of that?

00:06:39.353 --> 00:06:40.186 line:92%
- That was a lot! That was a lot.

00:06:42.553 --> 00:06:45.260 line:92%
So wait, what is something that's kind of amazed you?

00:06:45.260 --> 00:06:46.450 line:92%
