00:06:53.307 --> 00:06:54.487 size:78% position:39% line:92%
- Sounds about right.

00:06:54.487 --> 00:06:55.890 line:92%
- Like those people, they gave me a grill.

00:06:55.890 --> 00:06:57.410 line:92%
They made a grill for me.

00:06:57.410 --> 00:06:59.280 line:92%
I have a grill that I didn't wear today,

00:06:59.280 --> 00:07:01.050 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
