00:07:09.010 --> 00:07:09.843 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
- So, - Like, yeah.

00:07:09.843 --> 00:07:10.676 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
- Yes.

00:07:10.676 --> 00:07:12.180 line:92%
So, I got into, I went to Raging Waters.

00:07:12.180 --> 00:07:14.738 line:92%
There were, I got into a sensory deprivation pool.

00:07:14.738 --> 00:07:17.090 line:92%
But I also went to Texas.

00:07:17.090 --> 00:07:21.290 line:92%
