00:07:39.570 --> 00:07:40.403 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
- I love your show!

00:07:40.403 --> 00:07:41.820 size:81% position:41% line:92%
That's so interesting.

00:07:41.820 --> 00:07:42.653 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
- I do too.

00:07:42.653 --> 00:07:44.701 line:92%
- Yeah, it's so cool! Yeah.

00:07:44.701 --> 00:07:45.534 line:92%
Okay, I have a question though,

00:07:45.534 --> 00:07:49.000 line:92%
