00:07:56.340 --> 00:07:57.173 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
- It's unusual.

00:07:57.173 --> 00:08:00.110 line:92%
Because you're trying to come up with a name for your band.

00:08:00.110 --> 00:08:01.420 line:92%
- We are trying to come up with a name for my band.

00:08:01.420 --> 00:08:03.628 line:92%
