00:08:12.850 --> 00:08:13.920 line:92%
So, when we had to do it,

00:08:13.920 --> 00:08:15.140 line:92%
I said, "Hey, that's an interesting name."

00:08:15.140 --> 00:08:16.010 line:92%
She was a great lady too.

00:08:16.010 --> 00:08:16.843 size:75% position:38% line:92%
She lived to be 100.

00:08:16.843 --> 00:08:18.443 line:92%
- I love how you're like, "And your name is my band."

00:08:18.443 --> 00:08:20.030 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
(laughs)

00:08:20.030 --> 00:08:20.863 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
- What?

00:08:20.863 --> 00:08:21.696 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Well, I did.

00:08:21.696 --> 00:08:23.097 size:75% position:38% line:92%
She lived to be 104,

00:08:23.097 --> 00:08:24.337 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
