00:08:25.805 --> 00:08:26.700 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
- 104?

00:08:26.700 --> 00:08:27.537 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
- Yeah, yeah, yeah.

00:08:27.537 --> 00:08:28.370 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
